  "description": "Office automation library supporting read/write, template filling and format conversion for Excel (xlsx/xls), Word (docx/doc), PowerPoint (pptx/ppt), PDF, Markdown, RTF, ODS, Email (eml/msg), iCalendar, vCard, EPUB and XPS, with zero external dependencies and an MIT license. 办公自动化库，支持 Excel、Word、PPT、PDF、Markdown、RTF、ODS、Email、iCalendar、vCard、EPUB、XPS 等格式的读写、模板填充与格式转换，零外部依赖，MIT 许可。",
